        "as we can see the length attribute inside window set as CrossOrigin"
      ]
    },
    "\n",
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "props": {},
      "children": [
        "so we can access the .length for CrossOrigin site, and THIS IS THE KEY OF THE WHOLE LEAK!"
      ]
    },
    "\n",
    {
